# Make Disappear with casualty 1 (CR 702.153a): Bot1 sacrifices Dryad Arbor (a 1/1, power exactly 1) as it is cast. The casualty
# trigger copies the spell and Bot1 gives the copy a new target (CR 707.10c): the original counters Bot2's Lightning Bolt
# (a noncreature spell), the copy Bot2's Ornithopter (a creature spell). Bot2 holds one untapped Mountain, so it cannot pay
# {2} for either (! Bot2.PayCost, one mana made): both are countered, the Bolt does no damage. The copy is not a card: only the original goes to the graveyard.

